        "content": "**Scope:** records in bluesky_events inside the selected UTC window.\n\n**Counts:** collected events, including create / update / delete. Creation activity and language counts use **create** events only.\n\n**Delay:** received_at − time, in milliseconds; percentiles and active DIDs are estimates. This is receive delay, not confirmed database ingest latency."
